            "lines": [
              95,
              127
            ],
            "conclusion": "With `pledge = blue + l X^T X` (the inverse modification, X = d2 * blue), the modified metric `amend` is its inverse and `amend * d 1 = pink * d 1`, so H d1 = H^0 d1."
          }
